%% plays.glp --- the GAI mini-app activated as the super-app activates it (GSG paper, Section 2, "Activation and joining"): by run/3, under the type identity of its entry miniapp/4, with its grants; and, for three executions, alice's, alf's and bob's, with the two ends of each of three root channels handed to them as their conversations, alice's and alf's, alf's and bob's, and bob's and alice's, the play standing in for the social graph, as ../gsnp/plays.glp does for five.  The persons are scripted (person.glp), each under its role, alf's script the AI agent's program, and the play returns their screens.  A run does not end --- the agent's request question stays open and the person channel never closes --- so once each agent has taken its own transactions until none holds and no trigger is left, the run suspends, and a play's result is read off a partial stream.  The super-app hosting the mini-app on smartphones is ../gai_boot.glp.

imported procedure person#miniapp_person(Key?, Constant?, Channel(PersonOut(Drawn), PersonIn(Drawn))?, Stream(Seen)).

%% play_agents(A, R, B): the example of GAI's paper (Section 3.2, and Table "The components that change in the example"), on GAI's contract on GKK, GAI.glp at GLP 9d736804 (programs/gai/GAI.glp), alice and bob, persons, and alf, alice's AI agent, with a conversation between the executions of each two of them.  Each person establishes their identity (GKK:1, Identity); alice asks to come to know bob and he answers yes (GKK:2, Acquaintance); alice signs the code of alf, signed by acme_ltd, its developer (GSNP:1, Authorship; GAI:1, Developer), and enters her AI agent alf with it, which answers yes, becoming its principal and its friend, the two knowing each other, alf holding its attestation, the code signed over by alice (GnW:1, Guardianship; GAI:1; GAI:2, Principal); alf proposes to meet bob, presenting its attestation, and bob and alice, its principal, are asked and answer yes (GnW:2, Knowing and relations; agent_acquaint), bob recording alf, its principal and its attestation; alf, who knows bob by that meeting, proposes to befriend him, and bob and alice are asked and answer yes (GnW:2; agent_befriend); alf signs the item 'Today\'s summary of the news' (GSNP:1) and sends it to bob by message (GSN:1, Message), who holds it signed once, by alf, nobody asked; bob offers alice friendship and she answers yes (GSG:1, Friendship); alice retires alf (GAI:4, Retiring), which ends her friendship with it and its guardianship, alf asked nothing (GnW:3 and GnW:4); and bob ends his friendship with alf (GSG:2, Ending a friendship; unfriend_p(p?, q)).
exported procedure play_agents(Stream(Seen), Stream(Seen), Stream(Seen)).
play_agents(A?, R?, B?) :-
    self_module(M),
    find_type(miniapp/4, T),
    run(miniapp(alice, ch(GA?, WA), ch([conversation(alf, ch(RA?, AR)), conversation(bob, ch(BA?, AB))], _), []), T?, M?),
    person # miniapp_person(alice, alice, ch(WA?, GA), A),
    run(miniapp(alf, ch(GR?, WR), ch([conversation(alice, ch(AR?, RA)), conversation(bob, ch(BR?, RB))], _), []), T?, M?),
    person # miniapp_person(alf, alf, ch(WR?, GR), R),
    run(miniapp(bob, ch(GB?, WB), ch([conversation(alf, ch(RB?, BR)), conversation(alice, ch(AB?, BA))], _), []), T?, M?),
    person # miniapp_person(bob, bob, ch(WB?, GB), B).
